# COMBO (geno 11): XV2 heavy ender after light hits 1-4. Clip GOK_ATC_007 = BAC GOK_PLAYER 320 (BCM 0/18/2, 0/18/3/2,
# 0/18/3/3/2, 0/18/3/3/3/2: "Heavy" child of each light). BAC hit f16 dur 4. Limb: foot.R +9.23 Z at f16.
# Forward blowback (approved design: heavy forward = blowback). XV2's charge variant (BAC 322, BacEntryCharge) is not built.
PUT ANIM_RATE 1.0
# XV2 BAC Movement event f2 dur 14 (BAC 320); the step is GROUND_VEL x FACING, a design speed (the BAC record's speed is not decoded)
wait_until 2
GET ra_f:0 FACING
MUL ra_f:0 1.6
PUT GROUND_VEL ra_f:0
wait_until 9
GET ra_f:0 FACING
MUL ra_f:0 1.6
PUT GROUND_VEL ra_f:0
wait_until 16
hitbox slot=0 joint=@FOOT_R@ damage=11 size=4.0 x=0 y=0 z=0 angle=40 kbg=90 fkb=0 bkb=45
hitbox slot=1 joint=@CHEST@ damage=11 size=3.2 x=0 y=0 z=0 angle=40 kbg=90 fkb=0 bkb=45
PUT GROUND_VEL 0
wait_until 20
clear_hitboxes
wait_until 45
iasa
